<item>
      <title>Red notification for tropical cyclone CHAMPI-26. Population affected by Category 1 (120 km/h) wind speeds or higher is 0.233 million .</title>
      <description>From 14/10/2026 to 19/10/2026, a Hurricane/Typhoon &gt; 74 mph (maximum wind speed of 269 km/h) CHAMPI-26 was active in NWPacific. The cyclone affects these countries: Guam, Northern Mariana Islands, Japan (vulnerability Medium). Estimated population affected by category 1 (120 km/h) wind speeds or higher is 0.233 million .</description>
